-- ============================================================================
-- DC9 bank re-seed: ReservoirCalc Pro Beginner.
--
-- ASSESSMENT FIX, not a content change. The original seed
-- (20260824_dc9_reservoircalc_beginner_deep.sql) shipped a question bank in which
-- the correct option was the LONGEST of the four options far more often
-- than chance, which let a test-wise learner beat the pass mark without
-- knowing the material. Across the bank it was well above the 25 percent
-- a four-option question should show. This migration replaces the
-- question rows with a revised bank in which distractors were made more
-- specific and more plausible, and over-explained correct options were
-- tightened, bringing the rate down to 23 percent.
--
-- Every question keeps its prompt intent, its correct answer and its
-- answer_index; only option wording and explanations changed. No number
-- in the bank changed, and every one still traces to the course's
-- verified engine oracle.
--
-- Deliberately NOT touched: the academy_course_structures row for this
-- course-tier, including its enforced_from. Learners already on the deep
-- path stay on it and nobody is re-grandfathered.
--
-- Re-seeding replaces the whole bank for this course-tier, which is the
-- designed path (see the original seed's header) and is safe while no
-- attempts are open, since an open attempt pins question ids.
-- ============================================================================

delete from public.academy_quiz_questions
 where app_slug = 'reservoircalc' and tier = 'beginner';

